TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Aman,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} ne kadar sıradan olduğumu gördün.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Şey, insan her dakika şıklığın zirvesinde
olamaz, değil mi?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Sometimes I come in here and get
so distracted by all the shiny things
that I forget why I first came in{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Hay veces que entro, me distraigo
con la primera cosa que veo y se me
olvida qué he venido a comprar{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Spesso quando vengo qui, mi faccio
prendere dall'euforia e mi dimentico
cosa ero venuto a comprare{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Bazen buraya gelip parlak şeylere öyle
bir dalıyorum ki ilk başta niye geldiğimi
unutuyorum{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
